 205:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_pwr.c ****       After system reset, the backup domain (RTC registers, RTC backup data
 206:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_pwr.c ****       registers and backup SRAM) is protected against possible unwanted write
