 673:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_pwr.c ****   *         mode with all domains in DSTANDBY, if RUN_D3/RUN_SRD bit in CPUCR
 674:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_pwr.c ****   *         register is cleared.
